  "prefLabel": "Per 102.03 Accredited institution",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.03 “Accredited institution” means an institution providing post-secondary education that is recognized as accredited in the applicable discipline by the United States Department of Education, the Council for Higher Education Accreditation, or the NH department of education.\n\nSource. #14132-A, eff 11-27-24; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.02), eff 12-1-25",
